  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the cod fillets under cold water and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "In a large pot, combine the orange juice, water, carrots, potatoes, onion, garlic, thyme, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil over high heat, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the cod fillets to the pot and simmer for an additional 8 minutes, or until the fish is cooked through.",
    "Remove the pot from the heat and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
